{"_id": "testimonial-1", "_type": "testimonial", "quote": "He took the time to really understand who we were as an organisation… and used all of this to design what we have now! A complete brand identity, an online presence and a much greater sense of who we are.", "name": "Anna French", "org": "Leftfield Learning", "permission": true, "order": 1}
{"_id": "testimonial-2", "_type": "testimonial", "quote": "She brings senior marketing leadership, clear direction and the ability to turn strategy into action. At the BCA, she led our marketing through a significant moment of change. I would recommend Kat to any business looking for a strategic marketing partner who can understand the bigger picture, define the right approach and see it through to delivery.", "name": "Cait Allen, CEO", "org": "British Chiropractic Association, on Kat", "permission": false, "order": 2}
{"_id": "testimonial-3", "_type": "testimonial", "quote": "Chukuma has done excellent work for us for several years. As an artist he has a special gift for creating striking visuals matched with colours that draw you in. Highly recommend his graphic design work.", "name": "Mike J, Director", "org": "Frontiers UK, on Chuks", "permission": true, "order": 3}
{"_id": "testimonial-4", "_type": "testimonial", "quote": "She was always focused on strategic objectives, her people's needs and the expected impact of the work we were planning together. Effortlessly professional and conscientious.", "name": "Matt Dunphy, Lead Consultant", "org": "GetSavi, on Kat", "permission": false, "order": 4}
